{"reviewId": "66624168_85MYeWto7", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "拿正弦函数来形容，繁荣是x轴下方加速往上走的过程，衰退是x轴上方减速往上走到波顶，萧条是x轴上方加速往下走，回升是x轴下方减速走到谷底。这样才能对应正文中，所说的“顶指的是衰退期的结束”和“康波的谷指的是回升的结束”", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "2025-2121", "abstract": "需要注意的是，如果按照繁荣、衰退、萧条、回升四个阶段来划分康波，康波的顶指的是衰退期的结束，也就是说，繁荣和衰退是康波的上升期。而康波的谷指的是回升的结束，也就是说，萧条和回升是康波的下降期。", "type": 1, "isPrivate": 0, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "66624168_85MYeWto7", "userVid": 66624168, "topics": [], "createTime": 1767110518, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "userEditTime": 1767110548, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 66624168, "name": "六欲", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DdIiar5NmHkOH5TG8rmLR3BlB2CF6ibOa6MJvgibL4P08iboV8Bm3SSpPlJtZWQd8wxn2Qt8NiaXDekpWdWAYwyFPrbdoZCDgia8ADPibFDlpaUJqA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "六欲", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 7, "likes": [{"userVid": 243109623, "name": "Foon", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Yt36H8BIBGt1WxKOVURQ54JkPQ2RZrNxgicVNRx0ibZ6AufL1DN6FZRLDqNmnmfZqENQGDodgN1T9KJGqVGeDFXBWspgvmUTzHDKJicicibwKIz0/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "所以文中描述的曲线，和我们一般看到的曲线对应位置是不一样的，文中是以财富总量为纵轴，而网上大部分图是以财富增长速度为纵轴", "reviewId": "66624168_85MYeWto7", "comment